lm_cmb(22, 7, 364, 182, 150, 20, 4, "Order of the strum: UP low to high, DOWN high to low, ALT alternates per chord (a single note does not count as a group), RAND is shuffled by the seed (repeatable with a locked seed).");   // P26 (Historie: "... (not guaranteed identical between playback and render)"); P27 (A8/1.5.1): ALT kippt nur bei Akkorden
